  "QUESTION PRESENTED": ["heading", "framing"],
  "Under Title VII’s anti-retaliation provision, can Marisol Alvarez establish a prima facie case of retaliation against Brightwater Logistics, Inc., where she complained in writing to human resources about her supervisor’s sexist remarks and, five weeks later, was moved from the day shift to an overnight shift at a distant warehouse at the same pay?": [
    "issue",
    "law"
  ],
  "BRIEF ANSWER": ["heading", "framing"],
  "Probably yes.": ["conclusion", "conclusion"],
  "Alvarez’s written complaint is protected activity, and a reasonable worker could well be dissuaded from complaining by a forced move to overnight work.": [
    "conclusion",
    "conclusion"
  ],
  "Causation is the closest question, because Brightwater will argue that the transfer was planned before she complained, but the five-week gap and the supervisor’s role in the decision should be enough to make out a prima facie case.": [
    "conclusion",
    "conclusion"
  ],
  "STATEMENT OF FACTS": ["heading", "framing"],
  "Alvarez has worked as a shift lead at Brightwater’s Elmhurst distribution center since 2019. Alvarez Dep. 8:2-11.": [
    "facts",
    "client-fact"
  ],
  "Her supervisor, Grant Hollis, repeatedly told her in front of her crew that “women don’t belong on the loading dock.” Id. at 14:3-9.": [
    "facts",
    "client-fact"
  ],
  "On March 3, 2025, Alvarez submitted a written complaint to Brightwater’s human resources department describing Hollis’s remarks. Ex. A at 1.": [
    "facts",
    "client-fact"
  ],
  "Hollis learned of the complaint on March 6, when the HR manager interviewed him. Hollis Dep. 22:15-23:4.": [
    "facts",
    "client-fact"
  ],
  "On April 7, 2025, Brightwater transferred Alvarez to the overnight shift at its Joliet facility, forty miles from her home, at the same hourly rate. Ex. B at 3.": [
    "facts",
    "client-fact"
  ],
  "Hollis recommended the transfer in an email to the regional director. Ex. D at 2.": [
    "facts",
    "client-fact"
  ],
  "Brightwater’s operations plan, dated February 10, 2025, called for “rebalancing experienced leads across facilities,” but it did not name Alvarez or any other employee. Ex. C at 4.": [
    "facts",
    "client-fact"
  ],
  "Alvarez, a single parent of two school-age children, told us that the overnight schedule has left her without child care.": [
    "facts",
    "client-fact"
  ],
  "(Need to confirm with client whether she has records of the added child-care costs.)": [
